 *     (the x and y where the drag starts)
 *   - a MouseMotionListener whose mouseDragged adds the movement since the
 *     anchor to the running offsets, then moves the anchor to the new point
 *
 * getOffsetX() and getOffsetY() report the ACCUMULATED movement, so a fresh
 * press does not reset the totals -- it only re-anchors the next delta.
 *
 * Example (press at 50,50 then drag to 60,55 then drag to 65,45):
 *   deltas are (+10, +5) and then (+5, -10)
 *   getOffsetX() -> 15
 *   getOffsetY() -> -5
